    {
      "id": "P13",
      "situation": "The counselor reacts differently depending on the player's answer.",
      "speakerLocKey": "consult_speaker_counselor",
      "lines": [
        "Then the situation is a little different."
      ],
      "lineLocKeys": [
        "consult_p13_l0"
      ],
      "variants": [
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:business",
          "lines": [
            "If it's a business, then the situation is a little different.",
            "Your wealth pillar is active — but active in a way that puts the weight on you."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_business_l0",
            "consult_p13_business_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:invest",
          "lines": [
            "If it's investing, I need to look more carefully.",
            "Money moves quickly for you this year — quickly in both directions."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_invest_l0",
            "consult_p13_invest_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:side",
          "lines": [
            "A side income... that suits your chart.",
            "Your wealth arrives as several small streams rather than one large one."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_side_l0",
            "consult_p13_side_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:none",
          "lines": [
            "Having no specific plan is fine.",
            "But your chart says the opportunity will come to you — do not let it pass by."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_none_l0",
            "consult_p13_none_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:love_seeing",
          "lines": [
            "Getting to know someone... then this bond deserves a careful look.",
            "Your romance star is bright — but bright does not yet mean lasting."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_love_seeing_l0",
            "consult_p13_love_seeing_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:love_commit",
          "lines": [
            "Taking it further... that step needs the right moment.",
            "Your chart says this bond grows stronger when unhurried."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_love_commit_l0",
            "consult_p13_love_commit_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:love_healing",
          "lines": [
            "Just ended... then first the heart must settle.",
            "While the old bond lingers, the new one keeps its distance."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_love_healing_l0",
            "consult_p13_love_healing_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:love_single",
          "lines": [
            "Being on your own is not a loss.",
            "Your bonds arrive in seasons — what matters is opening the right door."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_love_single_l0",
            "consult_p13_love_single_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:biz_new",
          "lines": [
            "Something new... your energy wants to move.",
            "But movement needs a root — begin small and firm."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_biz_new_l0",
            "consult_p13_biz_new_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:biz_expand",
          "lines": [
            "Expanding asks how much your day pillar can carry.",
            "Within your strength it holds; one step too far and it slips."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_biz_expand_l0",
            "consult_p13_biz_expand_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:biz_stuck",
          "lines": [
            "A stall is not a dead end.",
            "Your luck is changing season — holding cash matters more than opening more."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_biz_stuck_l0",
            "consult_p13_biz_stuck_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:biz_exit",
          "lines": [
            "Thinking of stepping back... sometimes one step back keeps the whole board.",
            "Your chart's luck is not cut — this stretch just asks for a slower pace."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_biz_exit_l0",
            "consult_p13_biz_exit_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:career_move",
          "lines": [
            "A move... the door is ajar, not yet open.",
            "On the right beat you rise; one hasty step and you start over."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_career_move_l0",
            "consult_p13_career_move_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:career_grow",
          "lines": [
            "For advancement we look at your official star.",
            "This year a backer is present — do not stand where they cannot see you."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_career_grow_l0",
            "consult_p13_career_grow_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:career_start",
          "lines": [
            "Searching — then do not scatter too wide.",
            "Your chart favors a narrow, deep door — one craft that feeds you long."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_career_start_l0",
            "consult_p13_career_start_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:career_stay",
          "lines": [
            "Holding your place is also a move.",
            "This luck builds the root — and a firm root makes the next step higher."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_career_stay_l0",
            "consult_p13_career_stay_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:health_issue",
          "lines": [
            "Something worrying you... then listen to your body first, and me second.",
            "The chart can only point at the weak spot — the one to confirm it is a doctor."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_health_issue_l0",
            "consult_p13_health_issue_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:health_tired",
          "lines": [
            "Often drained means the energy is leaking.",
            "Drop one task, sleep one watch earlier — a small leak mended early never becomes illness."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_health_tired_l0",
            "consult_p13_health_tired_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:health_prevent",
          "lines": [
            "Guarding early — that is what those who know their chart do.",
            "Strong or weak, the body has its seasons — tend the right one and little is lost."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_health_prevent_l0",
            "consult_p13_health_prevent_l1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "branchTag": "plan:health_fine",
          "lines": [
            "Feeling fine is a blessing — still, the chart keeps one spot to watch.",
            "Do not spend today's health as an advance on tomorrow."
          ],
          "lineLocKeys": [
            "consult_p13_health_fine_l0",
            "consult_p13_health_fine_l1"
          ]
        }
      ],
